@page "/contact"
@{ViewData["Title"]="Visit & contact";ViewData["Page"]="contact";}
<section class="page-intro"><a href="/" class="breadcrumb">Home / Contact</a><span class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL CONNECTION</span><h1>A question?<br/><em>Let’s talk.</em></h1><p>Ask about a look, sizes, colours or delivery. The team will help you with the details before you decide.</p></section><section class="section contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Zahr Boutique</span><h2>Your next look<br/><em>starts here.</em></h2><a class="contact-number" href="@Shop.Settings.ContactUrl()" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@(Shop.Settings.UsesWhatsApp?Shop.Settings.DisplayPhone:"@zahr.boutique") ↗</a><p>@(Shop.Settings.UsesWhatsApp?"Start a conversation on WhatsApp.":"The boutique takes enquiries through Instagram direct messages.")</p><a class="text-link" href="@Shop.Settings.Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow the collection on Instagram ↗</a><p class="fine">Please confirm opening hours, visiting arrangements, delivery charges and current availability directly with the boutique.</p></div><div class="contact-picture"><img src="@Shop.Settings.Story" alt="Zahr Boutique collection detail" width="800" height="1050" loading="lazy"/></div></section>@if(Shop.Settings.Branches.Count>0){<section class="section branches"><span class="eyebrow">FIND THE BOUTIQUE</span><h2>A little closer<br/><em>to you.</em></h2><div class="branch-grid">@foreach(var branch in Shop.Settings.Branches){<article><h3>@branch.Name</h3><p>Confirm the exact location and opening hours with the team before visiting.</p><a class="text-link" href="@branch.MapUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the area on Maps ↗</a></article>}</div></section>}<section class="section faq"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU CHOOSE</span><h2>A few <em>helpful details.</em></h2><details><summary>How do I enquire about an outfit? <span>+</span></summary><p>Browse the collection, add the looks you love to your bag and prepare an enquiry. Review your message before opening @(Shop.Settings.UsesWhatsApp?"WhatsApp":"Instagram"). The team confirms availability and the final price.</p></details><details><summary>Which sizes and colours are available? <span>+</span></summary><p>Options can vary by piece. Ask about measurements, fit, colours and current availability before ordering.</p></details><details><summary>What about delivery, exchanges or payment? <span>+</span></summary><p>Confirm fees, delivery timing, payment methods and any exchange conditions directly with the boutique before placing your order.</p></details></section>
